-- the reading as a statement: the set over every schedule is exactly the x86-TSO set
-- (all four outcomes, the relaxed (0 , 0) among them), from 80 finished schedules, none cut by the bound
sb-set : List (List Word)
sb-set = cons (cons #0 (cons #0 nil)) (cons (cons #0 (cons #1 nil)) (cons (cons #1 (cons #0 nil)) (cons (cons #1 (cons #1 nil)) nil)))
